    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      201.55,
      397.27,
      226.89
    ],
    "text": "(b)printing, publishing and distribution of Buddhistbooks, magazines, journals, papers and programmes;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      237.55,
      397.13,
      274.89
    ],
    "text": "(c)setting up and maintenance of reading halls, lecturehalls, and academic institutions and study,promotion and propaganda of Buddhism;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      285.55,
      397.22,
      322.89
    ],
    "text": "(d)organising and conducting of all activities for theimprovement of Buddhist culture and moraldevelopment;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      333.55,
      397.21,
      382.89
    ],
    "text": "(e)to take steps to improve the way of life of theBuddhists and to promote national and religiouscustoms and to improve the spiritual virtues andsocial values;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      393.55,
      397.26,
      430.89
    ],
    "text": "(f)to take steps to save the younger generation fromsocial and economic hardships irrespective ofnational, religious and/or ethnic differences;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      441.55,
      397.28,
      478.89
    ],
    "text": "(g)to conduct social service activities in accordancewith Buddhist principles and to encourage theBuddhists to engage in such activities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      489.55,
      397.33,
      538.89
    ],
    "text": "(h)to establish and maintain institutions foreducational and social service activities such aschildrens\u2019 homes, elders\u2019 homes, hostels and othersocial service institutions.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      549.55,
      397.34,
      671.01
    ],
    "text": "4. Subject to the provisions of this Act, or other writtenlaw, the Corporation shall have the power to do, perform andexecute all such acts, matters and things what so ever as arenecessary or desirable for the promotion or furtherance ofthe objects of the Corporation or any one of them, includingthe power to open, operate and close bank accounts, toborrow or raise money, with or without security, to receive orcollect grants and donations, to invest its funds and toengage, employ and dismiss officers and servants requiredfor the carrying out of the objects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
