  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      201.67,
      402.0,
      288.81
    ],
    "text": "5. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe rules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Committee of Management consisting ofthe Director-General, the Honorary Secretary and theHonorary Treasurer and not less than six other members asmay be provided for in those rules and elected in accordancetherewith.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      300.07,
      402.05,
      350.37
    ],
    "text": "(2) The member of the Foundation, Rev. PahalagamaSri Somarathana Nayaka Thero shall be the Chairman of theBoard of Directors for life. The Chairman shall be the ChiefExecutive Officer of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      361.63,
      401.96,
      424.17
    ],
    "text": "(3) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall consist of the members of the Committeeof Management of the Foundation holding office on the daypreceding the date of commencement of this Act, and whosenames are specified in the Schedule to this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      435.43,
      402.0,
      497.97
    ],
    "text": "6. (1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation from timeto time, at any general meeting and by a majority of not lessthan two thirds of the members present and voting, to makerules, not inconsistent with the provisions of this Act or anyother written law, for all or any of the following matters :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
